OL,3,ANor'easter brings flooding as New York
OL,4,Aand New Jersey declare emergency
OL,5,
OL,6,FStates of emergency have been declared
OL,7,Fin New York and New Jersey, both of
OL,8,Fwhich faced a coastal deluge in some
OL,9,Fareas. Rain and strong winds are
OL,10,Fforecast from Virginia to Maine.
OL,12,FIn Brooklyn, a man was killed by a
OL,13,Ffalling tree, the BBC's US partner CBS
OL,14,FNews reported.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
